      "message": "silentpayments: factor out scan setup and output tweaking\n\nMove the argument checks, the shared secret creation and the\ncalculation of t_k and unlabeled_output out of\n`_recipient_scan_outputs` into helper functions, so that a second\nscanning function can share them.\n\nNo behavior change: the checks run in the same order and the same\nvalues are cleared on every return path.",
